{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":6034085,"ns":0,"title":"Colloid thruster","extract":"A colloid thruster (or electrospray thruster) is a type of low thrust electric propulsion rocket engine that uses electrostatic acceleration of charged liquid droplets for propulsion. In a colloid thruster, charged liquid droplets are produced by an electrospray process and then accelerated by a static electric field.","description":"Ion thruster subtype","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}